# CCM Weil-form smallest-eigenvector (ξ) disk cache.
#
# The toolkit writes ξ fixtures here as `<cwd>/data/weil_eigvec_cache/`
# when a run computes (or remote-fetches) a Weil eigenvector. The
# generated `.json` / `.json.zip` files are gitignored (see
# /.gitignore); this `.gitkeep` keeps the directory structure in the
# repo so the layout is self-documenting and present on a fresh clone.
#
# Public consolidated fixtures live at:
#   https://github.com/TeamXcelerator/xcelerator-weil-eigvec-cache
